# Release artifacts — Xcode archive intermediates only.
# .xcarchive is a build intermediate (not for distribution); the signed .ipa
# is exported separately into release-artifacts/ios/app-store-connect-*/.
# Distributable artifacts (apk / aab / ipa / release-notes) remain tracked
# per the existing release workflow and are not ignored here.
release-artifacts/ios/*.xcarchive/

